00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.173
And I understand that.

00:07:46.173 --> 00:07:47.006
- Yeah.

00:07:47.006 --> 00:07:47.839
- And then the flip side is

00:07:47.839 --> 00:07:50.520
I was really protected in
a very interesting way.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:53.910
And she was such an raging
alcoholic, not a rager

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:56.790
