00:07:56.790 --> 00:08:00.930
And my whole focus was keeping her alive.

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:02.241
So I had this-

00:08:02.241 --> 00:08:03.540
- Which is a weight that should not be on.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.070
